Third-party components
----------------------

None. Pantry has no third-party dependency and no CDN.

Vendored from this project's own kits (same licence, same author), copied verbatim
on 25/11/2026:

- web-kit 0.1.0 — docs/play/web-kit.js — the offline shell, storage helpers and PWA registration
- export-kit 1.0.0 — docs/play/export-kit.js — Blob download, used to write the export

Neither kit is modified. Neither makes a network request.

On the bundled dish index
-------------------------

The twelve dishes in docs/play/larder-core.js are ordinary Indian home dishes with their
usual ingredients. They are an app's content, not a claim about nutrition, health or
suitability for any medical condition — the app says so wherever it explains why a dish
fits your rules. No recipe, statistic or health claim is attributed to any source.
